# Styling and SLDS

- Prefer SLDS design tokens (e.g. `var(--slds-g-color-brand-base-50)`) over hard-coded hex/rgba in bundle CSS.
- Avoid inline `style` attributes with hard-coded colors — they override org branding and SLDS tokens.
- Keep brand/theming in the component `.css` file, not in template inline styles.
